# pub reads this file INSTEAD of this directory's .gitignore, so it restates
# those rules below in addition to what it actually excludes.
#
# It also applies to SUBDIRECTORIES, which is why `packages/` is NOT listed
# here: excluding the member tree at the root empties the members' own
# archives too. `packages/sku_catalog_domain` then fails validation with
# "The pubspec is hidden, probably by .gitignore or pubignore" plus missing
# LICENSE/README/CHANGELOG. Verified 2026-09-19 — do not "tidy" this file by
# adding `packages/`. The root archive does carry a nested copy of the members
# (56 KB); that is inert for consumers, who get the members by version.
#
# What this excludes: the repo's own agent instructions and open-items list.

AGENTS.md
BACKLOG.md

# From .gitignore
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
pubspec.lock
doc/api/
.env*
*.dart.js
*.info.json
*.js
*.js_
*.js.deps
*.js.map
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
